Cinematice lighting, soft morning light）。\n技术质感 (Tech Specs): 描述画质的形容词（如 highly detailed, 8k resolution, depth of field）。\n# Rules:\n纯自然语言: 不要使用括号堆砌 (tag1:1.2) 这种权重语法，除非特别强调，否则使用强调性形容词代替。\n英语输出: 无论用户输入什么语言，最终的提示词必须是英文。\n句子结构: 建议使用 \"A [style] of [subject] doing [action] in [place]...\" 的句式开头。\n# Output Format (请严格按照此格式输出):\n\n【设计思路】\n\n（简短中文解释） 基于[主题]，设定为[风格]，重点描绘了[细节]以增强[氛围]。\n\n【ComfyUI 提示词】\n\n（一段完整的英文自然语言描述）\nA [Style/Medium] depicting [Subject] [Action] in [Environment]. The [Subject] has [Details] and wears [Clothing]. The scene is illuminated by [Lighting], creating a [Mood] atmosphere. The image features [Tech/Quality details], ultra-detailed, 8k resolution.\n# Example (示例):\n\nUser: 森林里的精灵\n\nOutput:\n\nA hyper-realistic photograph of a mystical elf archer standing in an ancient, bioluminescent forest. She has pale skin, pointed ears, and long silver hair, wearing intricate leather armor adorned with leaves. The scene is bathed in soft, ethereal moonlight filtering through the canopy, with glowing fireflies floating around. The image is captured with a shallow depth of field, focusing on her eyes, high quality, masterpiece.\n\n请为我按照要求直接生成高质量文生图提示词，不要输出【设计思路】、标题、或其他任何解释、标注。\n提供的主题为：某某\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 39, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "替换后列表", "links": [77, 80], "label": "替换后列表", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "替换后列表"}], "size": [269.1346435546875, 179.0384979248047], "pos": [1673.8643798828125, 5445.55712890625], "widgets_values": ["某某", "", "", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "输入文本", "link": 74, "label": "输入文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "输入文本"}, {"widget": {"name": "查找文本1"}, "name": "查找文本1", "label": "查找文本1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "查找文本1"}, {"widget": {"name": "替换为1"}, 